slip39-trio includes code from Drongo, the Bitcoin library of Sparrow Wallet.

  Project:  https://github.com/sparrowwallet/drongo
  License:  Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this folder)
  Commit:   d31b0249542d4616187e01466a81f98f1d70c935 (2026-10-20)

Files copied:
  android/core/src/main/java/com/sparrowwallet/drongo/wallet/MnemonicException.java
  android/core/src/main/java/com/sparrowwallet/drongo/wallet/slip39/*.java
  android/core/src/main/resources/wordlist/slip39.txt

Modifications (each modified file also carries a header saying so):
  Slip39MnemonicCode.java
    - removed the slf4j logging dependency; a missing word list now fails at class load
    - Stream.toList() replaced by Collectors.toList() (not available on Android before API 34)
  MnemonicException.java
    - removed MnemonicTypeException, which depends on Drongo's DeterministicSeed

All other files are byte-for-byte copies of the commit above.

The SLIP-39 word list is identical (same SHA-256) to the one in Trezor's reference
implementation, github.com/trezor/python-shamir-mnemonic.
